ame Rate Limits AddedAnti-Aliasing Toggle and Quality LevelsPerformance OptimizationsDid a huge pass on VFX throughout the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T22:30:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329252761","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4485340-1835236783564774","game_id":"steam-4485340","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update - 06-12-2026","summary":"Fixed and Smoothing Ongoing - DevLog For Updates and Upcoming Closed Playtests: Sign Up Here! Hello All! This week's work was focused on improving readability and fixing bugs.I made some big changes in the font department, the feedback on the old font was that it didn't match the pixelation of the game as it was too smooth. Made some improvements by implementing a font I purchased off itch.io and I am quite happy with the style changes.I worked on adding SFX for several in-game details, doors no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T21:36:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4485340-1833968530894244","game_id":"steam-4485340","kind":"announcement","title":"A Stroll Through Act I","summary":"Closed Playtests have begun for Act I of Lock & StoneI'm very thankful for my industry friends who are helping me with these early tests!For Updates and Upcoming Closed Playtests: Sign Up Here! I wanted to show some of the locations features in Act I.The Forge is an expansive room with puzzles and a large forge at the far end for you to reach.Taking a load off are we? I hope that washes off...This hall has several diving tables, an eternally lit fireplace, and a big wraparound second 